	<info>
		<name>SeRe - Abstract #1 - Yellow</name>
		<description>Finally I created a big level (1810x1500) with 3 ways (hard, medium, easy). Good Luck and enjoy it! Btw: With Smoothitude 10 it would have 1,13MB; with Smoothitude Level 9 I had to delete some nodes too...</description>
